>> name: Tomato Pasta
>> description: A simple Italian-style tomato sauce pasta. Ready in 30 minutes.
>> servings: 2
>> tags: pasta, italian, quick

Bring a large #pot{} of salted water to a boil, then cook @pasta{200%g} until al dente.
While pasta cooks, heat @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #pan{} over medium heat.
Add @garlic{3%cloves} (thinly sliced) and cook gently for ~{2%min} until fragrant, not browned.
Add @tomatoes{400%g} (crushed), @salt{1%tsp}, and @pepper{to taste}.
Simmer on medium-low for ~{15%min} until the sauce thickens.
Reserve @pasta water{50%ml} before draining the pasta.
Add drained pasta to the sauce, toss with a splash of pasta water to loosen.
Finish with fresh @basil{} leaves and a drizzle of @olive oil{1%tbsp}.
